{"id":9184,"date":"2021-10-18T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-10-18T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/the-heart-of-applied-behavior-analysis-harnessing-existing-capacities-recognizing-new-opportunities\/"},"modified":"2024-10-17T10:44:30","modified_gmt":"2024-10-17T14:44:30","slug":"heart-aba-harnessing-existing-capacities-recognizing-new-opportunities","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/heart-aba-harnessing-existing-capacities-recognizing-new-opportunities\/","title":{"rendered":"Heart of ABA: Harnessing Existing Capacities, Recognizing New Opportunities"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9184\" class=\"elementor elementor-9184\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6a17c1ef elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6a17c1ef\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-574e3901\" data-id=\"574e3901\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f6d1f43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7f6d1f43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"><div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MTE3OTIxNw_the-heart-applied-behavior-analysis-rethink-bh-webinar_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MTE3OTIxNw_the-heart-applied-behavior-analysis-rethink-bh-webinar.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div><\/div><p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p><h2>What You\u2019ll Learn In This Webinar<\/h2><p>Foundational to our practice are ABA\u2019s commitment to:<\/p><ul><li>research-based interventions<\/li><li>high-quality <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/best-practices-for-implementing-rethinks-behavioral-health-products\/\">implementation of services<\/a><\/li><li>transparency<\/li><li>individualization<\/li><li>accountability<\/li><\/ul><p>At the heart of our work with clients and families is:<\/p><ul><li>collaboration<\/li><li>choice<\/li><li>acceptance<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/power-parent-advocacy\/\">self-advocacy<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/power-compassion-supporting-families-children-asd\/\">compassion<\/a><\/li><\/ul><p>Recognizing these values gives us much to be proud of and can also serve as a reminder that we are works in progress, as we actively embody these values to the fullest extent in our practice.<\/p><p>In this webinar, we will showcase several aspects of our work that embraces the humanity and heart of ABA.<\/p><h2>About the Guest Speaker<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ee04155 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ee04155\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8a179b2\" data-id=\"8a179b2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da515d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"da515d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/dr-david-celiberti.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-17792\" alt=\"Black and white headshot of Dr. David Celiberti\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/dr-david-celiberti.jpg 500w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/dr-david-celiberti-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/dr-david-celiberti-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-535e7e0\" data-id=\"535e7e0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15c5633 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"15c5633\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Dr. David Celiberti<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Executive Director for Association for Science in Autism Treatment<\/span><\/p><p>Dr. David Celiberti is the Executive Director of the Association for Science in Autism Treatment and the Past-President of its Board of Directors, a role he served from 2006 and 2012. He is the Co-Editor of ASAT\u2019s online publication, Science in Autism Treatment. He received his Ph.D. in clinical psychology from Rutgers University in 1993 and his board certification in behavior analysis in 2000.<\/p><p>Dr. Celiberti has served on a number of advisory boards and special interest groups in the field of autism, applied behavior analysis, and early childhood education. He works in private practice and provides consultation to public and private schools and agencies in underserved areas and minority communities. He has authored several articles in professional journals and presents frequently at regional, national, and international conferences. In prior positions, Dr. Celiberti taught courses related to applied behavior analysis (ABA) at both the undergraduate and graduate levels, supervised individuals pursuing BCBA certifications, and conducted research in the areas of ABA, family intervention, and autism.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15017,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Heart of ABA: Harness Capacity, Recognize Opportunities","_seopress_titles_desc":"In this webinar, we will showcase several aspects of our work that embraces the humanity and heart of ABA and its commitment to research-based interventions.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[327,329,69,230],"resource-tag":[365],"class_list":["post-9184","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-aba","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-business","resource-topic-research","resource-tag-collaboration"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9184","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9184\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/15017"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=9184"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=9184"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=9184"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-topic?post=9184"},{"taxonomy":"resource-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-tag?post=9184"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}